{"result":"{
  "id": "18362",
  "key": "SFCC-196",
  "summary": "PDP UI – Maximum Purchase Quantity",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18362",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to be clearly informed when I've reached the maximum purchase limit for a product,\n\n**so that** I understand why I can't add more to my bag.\n\n----\n\nScreenshot (Figma is leading): \n\n![\"image-20260729-014706.png\"](image-20260729-014706.png)\n\nSFCC enforces a configurable maximum purchase quantity at a global level. Initially, this will be set at 3. Since the PDP has no quantity selector, enforcement is triggered when a shopper clicks Add to Bag multiple times for the same size. The system tracks how many units of the same variant are already in the shopper's bag and prevents addition beyond the configured limit. When the limit is reached, an inline message is displayed.",
  "status": {
    "name": "Ready for Development",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "Medium"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "DesignDependent",
    "PRD-011",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-07-20T16:34:46.272+1000",
  "updated": "2026-08-26T11:07:44.971+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13595",
      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d This is pretty much ready to go but there should be a default value (example max 3 units) and then if we want to configure a different value for either a specific SKU or a customer group then those would take priority.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-30T18:54:00.757+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-30T18:54:00.757+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13601",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 Hey Emma - thanks for pointing this out - that also inspired me to split this story into 2 - one for the UI - one for the merchandiser perspective in BM. The second ticket is [SFCC-268 PDP – Maximum Purchase Quantity – BM Config - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-268)\n\nI assigned both to you for your review - but pending a decision on which takes priority (AC highlighted in red). For now I have written it as if the customer group takes priority over the SKU limit. Perhaps it’s the other way around or perhaps the logic is - whichever has the highest limit, applies? Let me know and I’ll get it updated.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-31T15:02:48.339+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-31T15:02:48.339+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13727",
      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d are the rules around the priority configurable later? Ultimately the lowest level should take priority, so if there is a SKU level limit this would take priority, if there is a customer group this would be next and default is the fallback. \n\ncc User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-10T10:21:35.694+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-10T10:21:35.694+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13783",
      "body": "Refinement: Split out customer group / SKU into an enhancement ticket\n\nMax purchase limit - 3 - global setting - should be configurable is - update current ticket \n\nUser:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-11T14:24:56.074+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-11T14:24:56.074+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13784",
      "body": "User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 FYI - we discussed this yesterday, regarding the max purchase quantity per customer group / SKU - we are going to split it out. \nThis SFCC-196](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-196) will be the globally defined max purchase limit and then I logged an enhancement for setting it per customer group / SKU ([[SFCC-703 PDP – Maximum Purchase Quantity Override by Customer Group and SKU - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-703)). \nCC: User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-11T15:22:52.178+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-11T15:22:52.178+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13785",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341  updated this as agreed in our refinement today and created enhancement [SFCC-703](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-703)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-11T15:56:31.855+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-11T15:56:31.855+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13802",
      "body": "Thanks Jas",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-11T21:02:09.692+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-11T21:02:09.692+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14049",
